# ==============================================================================
# 📖 API ENDPOINTS REFERENCE SHEET
# ==============================================================================
#
# ─── SYSTEM & HEALTH ──────────────────────────────────────────
# GET  /api/health                       → Server and MongoDB status check
# GET  /admin                            → Admin Panel web console
#
# ─── AUTHENTICATION ───────────────────────────────────────────
# POST /api/auth/login                   → Admin login ({username, password})
# GET  /api/auth/me                      → Verify JWT token
# POST /api/auth/change-password         → Change admin password in MongoDB
#
# ─── SUBJECTS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# GET  /api/subjects                     → List all subjects
# POST /api/subjects                     → Create subject (Admin)
# PUT  /api/subjects/:id                 → Update subject (Admin)
# DEL  /api/subjects/:id                 → Delete subject (Admin)
#
# ─── QUIZZES ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# GET  /api/quizzes                      → Available quizzes for students
# GET  /api/quizzes/:id                  → Quiz details
# POST /api/quizzes                      → Create new quiz (Admin)
# PUT  /api/quizzes/:id                  → Edit quiz (Admin)
# DEL  /api/quizzes/:id                  → Delete quiz (Admin)
#
# ─── STUDENT EXAMINATION WORKFLOW ─────────────────────────────
# POST /api/quizzes/:id/verify-student   → Register/verify student before quiz
# POST /api/quizzes/:id/start            → Start exam timer & receive questions
# POST /api/quizzes/:id/submit           → Submit answers & calculate score
#
# ─── RESULTS & CERTIFICATES ───────────────────────────────────
# GET  /api/results/:attemptId           → Get student result details
# GET  /api/results/:attemptId/certificate → Download 1-Page Certificate PDF
# GET  /api/results/:attemptId/pdf       → Download Detailed Result Card PDF
#
# ─── MEDIA UPLOADS ────────────────────────────────────────────
# POST /api/upload/image                 → Upload diagram/image to Cloudinary
# POST /api/upload/audio                 → Upload audio prompt to Cloudinary
#
# ─── ADMIN DASHBOARD STATS ────────────────────────────────────
# GET  /api/admin/stats                  → Live dashboard metrics & counts
# GET  /api/admin/attempts               → All student attempts with filters
# GET  /api/admin/questions              → Question bank management
# ==============================================================================
